---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/article.css';
import '../styles/manage.css';
---
<Layout title="写作空间" active="manage" description="写下想法，整理文档，让值得留下的知识慢慢生长。">
  <div class="writing-shell">
    <header class="writing-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A PLACE TO THINK ON PAPER</span><h1>让思考，落在纸上<span>。</span></h1><p>从一段新想法开始，或接着已有的文档往下写。</p></div><div class="writing-heading-actions"><button class="button" id="open-import"><Icon name="download" size={16} /> 导入文档</button><button class="button button-primary" id="new-document"><span>＋</span> 新建文档</button></div></header>
    <div class="workspace-notice" id="workspace-notice" role="status" hidden></div>
    <div class="writing-layout">
      <aside class="document-sidebar" aria-label="我的文档">
        <div class="sidebar-heading"><h2>我的文档</h2><span id="document-total">—</span></div>
        <div class="document-search"><Icon name="search" size={16} /><input id="manage-search" type="search" placeholder="查找标题、正文或标签…" aria-label="搜索我的文档" autocomplete="off" /></div>
        <div class="document-tabs" role="group" aria-label="文档状态"><button data-status="all" class="active" aria-pressed="true">全部 <span id="count-all">0</span></button><button data-status="draft" aria-pressed="false">草稿 <span id="count-draft">0</span></button><button data-status="published" aria-pressed="false">已发布 <span id="count-published">0</span></button><button data-status="trash" aria-pressed="false">垃圾箱 <span id="count-trash">0</span></button></div>
        <div id="document-list" class="document-list" aria-live="polite"><p class="list-hint">正在整理你的文档…</p></div>
        <button id="load-more-documents" class="load-more-documents" hidden>加载更多文档</button>
        <div class="storage-note"><span class="live-dot"></span><p id="storage-status">文档与图片保存在你的服务器</p></div>
      </aside>
      <section class="writing-canvas" aria-label="文档编辑器">
        <div id="editor-empty" class="editor-empty"><span class="empty-paper" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT IDEA STARTS HERE</span><h2>给一个想法，留一页纸。</h2><p>站内写作会自动保存草稿。也可以把 Markdown、TXT 和配套图片一起带进来。</p><div><button class="button button-primary" id="empty-new-document">写第一篇文档</button><button class="quiet-link mint" id="empty-import">导入已有文档 <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></button></div><span class="empty-footnote">草稿只在写作空间出现，发布后才进入阅读与搜索。</span></div>
        <div id="editor-panel" hidden>
          <div class="editor-topbar"><div class="editor-state"><span id="document-status" class="status-pill">草稿</span><span id="save-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">所有修改已保存</span></div><div class="editor-actions"><button class="small-action" id="save-document">保存 <kbd>⌘ S</kbd></button><a class="small-action" id="view-document" href="/articles/" hidden>查看文章 ↗</a><button class="small-action" id="unpublish-document" hidden>撤回发布</button><button class="small-action" id="restore-document" hidden>恢复为草稿</button><button class="small-action danger" id="trash-document">移入垃圾箱</button><button class="small-action danger" id="delete-document" hidden>永久删除</button><button class="button button-primary publish-button" id="publish-document">发布文档 <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></button></div></div>
          <div id="editor-problem" class="editor-problem" role="alert" hidden><p id="editor-problem-text"></p><div><button class="quiet-link" id="retry-save">重新保存</button><button class="quiet-link" id="reload-document" hidden>重新加载服务器版本</button><button class="quiet-link" id="download-local">下载当前未保存原文</button></div></div>
          <div class="document-metadata"><label class="sr-only" for="document-title">文档标题</label><input id="document-title" class="document-title" type="text" maxlength="200" placeholder="给这段思考一个标题" /><label class="sr-only" for="document-description">文档摘要</label><textarea id="document-description" class="document-description" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="用一两句话，写下这篇文档值得阅读的理由…"></textarea><details class="metadata-details"><summary>文档信息 <span id="metadata-summary">标签、日期、分类与封面</span><span class="details-plus">＋</span></summary><div class="metadata-fields"><label>标签<input id="document-tags" type="text" placeholder="用逗号分隔，例如：阅读笔记，实践" maxlength="1500" /></label><label>分类 <span>可选</span><input id="document-category" type="text" placeholder="由你的内容决定" maxlength="100" /></label><label>日期<input id="document-date" type="date" /></label><label class="cover-field">封面 <span>可选</span><div><input id="document-cover" type="text" placeholder="上传图片，或填写站内图片路径" maxlength="2048" /><button type="button" id="upload-cover" aria-label="上传封面图片">上传</button></div></label></div></details></div>
          <div class="editor-modebar"><div class="editor-modes" role="group" aria-label="编辑视图"><button data-mode="write" aria-pressed="true" class="active">Markdown</button><button data-mode="split" aria-pressed="false">对照预览</button><button data-mode="preview" aria-pressed="false">预览</button></div><div class="editor-export"><button id="export-markdown" title="下载包含元数据的 Markdown">导出 .md</button><button id="export-bundle" title="下载 Markdown 与配套图片 ZIP">打包导出</button></div></div>
          <div class="source-toolbar" id="source-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Markdown 格式"><button data-insert="heading" title="插入二级标题">H₂</button><button data-insert="bold" title="插入粗体"><strong>B</strong></button><button data-insert="code" title="插入代码块">&lt;/&gt;</button><button data-insert="link" title="插入链接">↗ 链接</button><button id="upload-inline-image"><Icon name="download" size={14} /> 图片</button><span>Markdown · 支持代码、表格和引用</span></div>
          <div class="editor-body" id="editor-body" data-mode="write"><div class="source-pane"><label class="sr-only" for="document-source">Markdown 正文</label><textarea id="document-source" spellcheck="false" placeholder="从这里开始，让一个想法慢慢清晰。&#10;&#10;## 一个值得深入的问题&#10;&#10;写下观察、判断，以及下一步想验证的事…"></textarea></div><div class="preview-pane" id="preview-pane" hidden><div class="preview-caption"><span class="eyebrow">READING PREVIEW</span><span id="preview-status">与正式文章使用相同渲染</span></div><article class="prose writing-preview" id="document-preview"></article></div></div>
          <div class="editor-bottom"><span id="document-word-count">0 字符</span><span id="document-updated">草稿会自动保存到服务器</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
  <dialog id="import-dialog" aria-labelledby="import-title"><div class="import-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR KNOWLEDGE HOME</span><h2 id="import-title">把已有的思考，带进来<span>。</span></h2></div><button class="icon-button" id="close-import" aria-label="关闭导入"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><p class="import-intro">Markdown、TXT 与 PNG / JPG / GIF / WebP 图片。配图请与文档一起选择文件夹，保留原有相对路径。</p><div class="import-dropzone" id="import-dropzone"><span aria-hidden="true">↥</span><h3>拖入文档和配套图片</h3><p>每批最多 32 MB、500 个文件 · 单篇正文 2 MB · 单图 8 MB</p><div><button class="button button-primary" id="choose-import-files">选择文件</button><button class="button" id="choose-import-folder">选择文件夹</button></div></div><input id="import-files" class="sr-only" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" type="file" multiple accept=".md,.markdown,.txt,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.gif,.webp" /><input id="import-folder" class="sr-only" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" type="file" multiple /><div class="import-selection" id="import-selection" hidden><div><strong id="import-selection-count"></strong><button id="clear-import-selection" class="quiet-link">清空选择</button></div><p id="import-selection-detail"></p><ul id="import-file-list"></ul><p id="import-skip-note" hidden></p></div><p id="import-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div id="import-report" class="import-report" hidden></div><div class="import-footer"><span>导入后先保存为草稿，检查后再发布。</span><button class="button button-primary" id="confirm-import" disabled>导入为草稿 <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></button></div></dialog>
  <input id="editor-image-input" class="sr-only" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp" />
  <script>import '../scripts/manage/index';</script>
</Layout>
